{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# gl(3), L = 1, general site rep — deriving $\\Psi^{\\rm ref}$ and $c^{\\rm ref}$ from direct diagonalization\n\nThe L=2 scan (`SU3_L2_ZeroTwist_Scan.wb`) shows that the zero-twist formula holds only when both sites have $\\lambda_2=1$. The suspects are the one-site normalization factors, which were derived for the adjoint in `SU3_L1_Baxter_Twisted_Final.wb`:\n$$\n\\Psi^{\\rm ref}_B=\\Psi_B(\\{1\\},\\{0,0\\}),\\qquad c^{\\rm ref}_A=\\text{coefficient of }\\Psi_B(\\{1\\},\\{0,0\\})\\text{ in the residue expansion of }\\det N^{AB}.\n$$\nSo $\\det N=c^{\\rm ref}\\Psi^{\\rm ref}\\,(1+\\text{ratios of Q's})$.\n\n**Here**, for each site rep $\\lambda\\in\\{[1,0,0],[1,1,0],[2,0,0],[3,0,0],[2,1,0],[3,1,0],[2,2,0]\\}$ at finite twist:\n1. direct diagonalization gives $\\mathcal S_{\\rm vec}(A,A)=1/(\\langle L_A|0\\rangle\\langle0|R_A\\rangle)$ with branch-I references;\n2. twisted Q's (degrees $\\lambda_1-\\mu_i$, $\\mu_j$) give $\\det N^{AB}$: rows $(1,3),(1,2),(2,3)$ as at L=2, columns $(-Q^jQ_i,\\,Q^jQ_i^{[-2]},\\,Q^{j[2]}Q_i)$, measure poles $\\theta+\\{\\lambda_3,\\dots,\\lambda_1\\}$;\n3. $\\det N$ is expanded formally in $Q_i(\\theta+n)$, $Q^j(\\theta+n)$. For every SoV label $(n_{21};n_{11},n_{12})=(m_{12};m_{11},m_{22})$ of the rep, $c[ns]$ is read off as the coefficient of $\\Psi_B[ns]=Q_1(x_{21})[Q_1(x_{11})Q_2(x_{12}-1)-Q_2(x_{11})Q_1(x_{12}-1)]$;\n4. the label for which $\\det N/(c[ns]\\Psi_B[ns])\\propto\\mathcal S_{\\rm vec}$ over all states is identified.\n\nConventions as at L=2: $h=1$, $\\theta=1/3$, unimodular $z=(5/2,7/3,6/35)$, 150 digits. Symbols carry the suffix `K`.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 1. L=1 machinery for any gl(3) site rep: generators, twisted transfer matrices, Baxter operators, references. ---- *)\nClearAll[showK, thetaK, zK, zNK, precK, repsK, repK, dsK, EK, wtK, TmK, qminK, TK, nuK, qdetK, setupRepK, BaxDirK, BaxDualK,\n  qpolyK, solveMonicK, nilExpK, refBraK, refKetK, rhoK, chainCheckK, u];\n\nshowK[e_] := StringReplace[ToString[e, InputForm], {\"{\" -> \"(\", \"}\" -> \")\"}];\n\n(* GT machinery: identical to the other notebooks (memoized per rep). *)\nps[rr_] := ps[rr] = Block[{res = Prepend[rr, #] & /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rr[[1, i + 1]], rr[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rr[[1]]] - 1}]]},\n    If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse@Sort@res, Reverse@Sort@Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]];\ndim[rr_] := dim[rr] = Length[ps[{rr}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/\n       Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}] v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rr_] := JJ[k, l, rr] = Which[\n    k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rr}]],\n    l == k + 1, Transpose@Table[Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rr}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rr}], {i, Length[ps[{rr}]]}],\n    l == k - 1, Transpose@Table[Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rr}][[i]]], v[#]] & /@ ps[{rr}], {i, Length[ps[{rr}]]}],\n    l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rr].JJ[k + 1, l, rr] - JJ[k + 1, l, rr].JJ[k, k + 1, rr],\n    l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rr].JJ[k - 1, l, rr] - JJ[k - 1, l, rr].JJ[k, k - 1, rr]];\n\nthetaK = 1/3;\nzK = {5/2, 7/3, 6/35};  (* unimodular, as at L=2 *)\nprecK = 150;\nzNK = N[zK, precK];\nrepsK = {{1, 0, 0}, {1, 1, 0}, {2, 0, 0}, {3, 0, 0}, {2, 1, 0}, {3, 1, 0}, {2, 2, 0}};\n\n(* One site: T_ij(u) = (u - theta) delta_ij - E_ji; T_a = sum_{|I|=a} z_I qmin_{I,I}. *)\nTmK[i_, j_][x_] := (x - thetaK) KroneckerDelta[i, j] IdentityMatrix[dsK] - EK[j, i];\nqminK[II_][x_] := Sum[Signature[s] Dot @@ Table[TmK[II[[s[[k]]]], II[[k]]][x - (k - 1)], {k, Length[II]}],\n   {s, Permutations[Range[Length[II]]]}];\nsetupRepK[r_] := (repK = r; dsK = dim[r]; Clear[EK, TK];\n   Do[EK[i, j] = JJ[i, j, r], {i, 3}, {j, 3}];\n   wtK = Transpose[Table[Diagonal[EK[i, i]], {i, 3}]];\n   Do[TK[a] = Expand[Sum[(Times @@ zK[[II]]) qminK[II][u], {II, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}]], {a, 3}]);\n\nnuK[i_][x_] := x - thetaK - repK[[i]];\nqdetK[x_] := nuK[1][x - 2] nuK[2][x - 1] nuK[3][x];\n\n(* Reduced Baxter operators, same form as at L=2 (unimodular twist): direct gauge nu1, dual gauge nu3. *)\nBaxDirK[T1_, T2_, z_][q_][x_] := (z nuK[1][x] nuK[1][x - 1] nuK[1][x - 2] q[x + 1] - (T1 /. u -> x) nuK[1][x - 1] nuK[1][x - 2] q[x]\n    + (T2 /. u -> x) nuK[1][x - 2] q[x - 1]/z - qdetK[x] q[x - 2]/z^2);\nBaxDualK[T1_, T2_, y_][g_][x_] := (nuK[3][x + 1] nuK[3][x + 2] nuK[3][x + 3] g[x] - y (T1 /. u -> x + 1) nuK[3][x + 2] nuK[3][x + 3] g[x + 1]\n    + y^2 (T2 /. u -> x + 2) nuK[3][x + 3] g[x + 2] - y^3 qdetK[x + 3] g[x + 3]);\nqpolyK[cl_List, y_] := Fold[#1 y + #2 &, 0, Reverse[cl]];\nsolveMonicK[op_, degree_] := Module[{c, x, q, eqs, aa, bb, sol, res, scale},\n  q = Function[y, Evaluate[y^degree + Sum[c[m] y^m, {m, 0, degree - 1}]]];\n  eqs = CoefficientList[Expand[op[q][x]], x];\n  aa = Table[Coefficient[e, c[m]], {e, eqs}, {m, 0, degree - 1}];\n  bb = eqs /. c[_] -> 0;\n  sol = If[degree == 0, {}, LeastSquares[aa, -bb]];\n  res = If[degree == 0, bb, aa.sol + bb];\n  scale = Max[Join[{1}, Abs@Flatten[{aa, bb}]]];\n  {Append[sol, 1], Max[Abs[res]]/scale}];\n\n(* Branch-I reference covector/vector (a13 = 3/5, a23 = 4/7), exactly as at L=2. *)\nnilExpK[mat_, c_] := Module[{acc = IdentityMatrix[Length[mat]], term = IdentityMatrix[Length[mat]]},\n   Do[term = c term.mat/k; acc += term, {k, 1, 8}]; acc];\nrefBraK[z_] := With[{a12 = -z[[2]] (z[[1]] - z[[3]])/(z[[1]] (z[[2]] - z[[3]])) (3/5)/(4/7), n = dsK},\n   UnitVector[n, 1].nilExpK[EK[1, 2], a12].nilExpK[EK[1, 3], 3/5].nilExpK[EK[2, 3], 4/7]];\nrefKetK[z_] := With[{a12 = -z[[2]] (z[[1]] - z[[3]])/(z[[1]] (z[[2]] - z[[3]])) (3/5)/(4/7), a13 = 3/5, a23 = 4/7, n = dsK},\n   nilExpK[EK[2, 1], -z[[1]] (z[[1]] - z[[3]])/(a12 z[[2]] (z[[2]] - z[[3]]))].\n    nilExpK[EK[3, 1], -z[[1]]^2/(a13 z[[3]]^2)].\n    nilExpK[EK[3, 2], -z[[2]]^2 (z[[1]] - z[[3]])/(a23 (z[[1]] - z[[2]]) z[[3]]^2)].UnitVector[n, 1]];\nrhoK[a_, k_] := Prime[7 a + k + 1]/(11 + 2 a + k);\n\nchainCheckK[r_] := (setupRepK[r];\n   {Row[r, \",\"], dsK,\n    And @@ Table[Expand[TK[3] - qdetK[u] IdentityMatrix[dsK]] === ConstantArray[0, {dsK, dsK}], {1}],\n    And @@ Flatten@Table[With[{A = Coefficient[TK[a], u, k], B = Coefficient[TK[b], u, l]}, A.B - B.A === ConstantArray[0, {dsK, dsK}]],\n       {a, 2}, {b, 2}, {k, 0, a}, {l, 0, b}]});\nGrid[Prepend[chainCheckK /@ repsK, {\"rep\", \"dim\", \"T3 = nu1(u-2) nu2(u-1) nu3(u)\", \"T1, T2 coefficients commute\"}],\n Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"752601\" data-output-id=\"68\" data-out-n=\"792\" data-sub-idx=\"32\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"1\" data-sub-start=\"72\" data-sub-end=\"73\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[792]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"10\" data-latex-b64=\"\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:9.64em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.09em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rep</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dim</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">15</span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T3 = nu1(u-2) nu2(u-1) nu3(u)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-c\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:5.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-7.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">T1, T2 coefficients commute</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.81em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.61em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.41em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.21em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.01em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:1.19em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">True</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:0.5em;\"></span><span class=\"vertical-separator\" style=\"height:9.6em;border-right-width:0.04em;border-right-style:solid;margin:0 -0.02em;vertical-align:-4.55em;\"></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-6.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-7.3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-8.5em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-9.7em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-10.9em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-12.1em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:7.05em;\"></span><span class=\"hline\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:4.55em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
