      {
       "data": "Out[814]= \\begin{matrix}\\begin{matrix}\\text{rep }1,0,0\\text{:  orthogonality (max cross/min diag) = }2.66\\times 10^{-152}\\text{,  lowest-GT label (lambda2; lambda3, lambda3) = }0,0,0\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{label (n21;n11,n12)} & \\text{c[ns] consistent} & \\text{spread of det N/(c Psi)/S} & \\text{value (vacuum) = 1/C\\_vac}\\\\\\hline0,0,0 & \\mathrm{True} & 0.\\times 10^{-143} & 0.970238\\\\\\hline1,0,0 & \\mathrm{False} & 109 & -0.0619772\\\\\\hline1,1,0 & \\mathrm{True} & 3100 & 0.0620952\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\end{matrix}\\\\\\begin{matrix}\\text{rep }1,1,0\\text{:  orthogonality (max cross/min diag) = }4.91\\times 10^{-153}\\text{,  lowest-GT label (lambda2; lambda3, lambda3) = }1,0,0\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|}\\hline\\text{label (n21;n11,n12)} & \\text{c[ns] consistent} & \\text{spread of det N/(c Psi)/S} & \\text{value (vacuum) = 1/C\\_vac}\\\\\\hline1,0,0 & \\mathrm{False} & 0.\\times 10^{-142} & 171.301\\\\\\hline1,1,0 & \\mathrm{True} & 27.1 & -6.07570\\\\\\hline1,1,1 & \\mathrm{True} & 3100 & 0.862997\\\\\\hline\\end{array}\\end{matrix}\\\\\\begin{matrix}\\text{rep }2,0,0\\text{:  orthogonality (max cross/min diag) = }5.86\\times 10^{-144}\\text{,  lowest-GT label (lambda2; lambda3, lambda3) = }0,0,0\\\\\\begin{array}{|c|c|c|c|… [latex truncated: 5214 chars total]",
