  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* ---- 4. Section 3's single-monomial coefficient is ambiguous (monomials are shared between labels; for the adjoint it\n   misses one of the two terms of the known c^ref). SoV logic instead: <0|R_B> ~ Psi_B(x_ref), <L_A|0> ~ D_A(y_ref), so\n   S_A Psi_A(x) D_A(y)/det N_AA must be A-independent at the reference points. Scan all (x, y) in a box of shifts.\n   Psi_B(a;b,c) = Q_1(a)[Q_1(b) Q_2(c-1) - Q_2(b) Q_1(c-1)],  D_A(a;b,c) = Q^3(a)[Q^3(b) Q^2(c+1) - Q^2(b) Q^3(c+1)];\n   the adjoint c^ref is (D(1;0,0) - D(0;0,1))/4. ---- *)\nClearAll[boxK, psiNK, dualNK, matchPairsK, matchTabK, oldCheckK];\n\nboxK[r_] := Tuples[Range[r[[3]] - 1, r[[1]] + 1], 3];\npsiNK[s_, {a_, b_, c_}] := QDK[s, 1, a] (QDK[s, 1, b] QDK[s, 2, c - 1] - QDK[s, 2, b] QDK[s, 1, c - 1]);\ndualNK[s_, {a_, b_, c_}] := QUK[s, 3, a] (QUK[s, 3, b] QUK[s, 2, c + 1] - QUK[s, 2, b] QUK[s, 3, c + 1]);\n\n(* All (x, y) with S_A Psi_A(x) D_A(y)/det N_AA constant over every state A to < 1e-40 (30-digit arithmetic). *)\nmatchPairsK[r_] := matchPairsK[r] = Module[{st = statesK[r], g, P, D, pa, db, xs, ys, keyA, keyB, res = {}},\n   xs = boxK[r]; ys = boxK[r];\n   g = N[Table[s[\"S\"]/detNK[r, s, s], {s, st}], 30];\n   P = N[Table[psiNK[s, x], {x, xs}, {s, st}], 30];\n   D = N[Table[dualNK[s, y], {y, ys}, {s, st}], 30];\n   (* normalized profiles over states; a pair matches iff profile(x) * profile(y) = 1 componentwise *)\n   pa = Table[If[Min[Abs[P[[k]]]] < 10^-25, Nothing, {xs[[k]], g P[[k]]/(g[[1]] P[[k, 1]])}], {k, Length[xs]}];\n   db = Table[If[Min[Abs[D[[k]]]] < 10^-25, Nothing, {ys[[k]], D[[k]]/D[[k, 1]]}], {k, Length[ys]}];\n   Do[If[Max[Abs[x[[2]] y[[2]] - 1]] < 10^-20, AppendTo[res, {x[[1]], y[[1]]}]], {x, pa}, {y, db}];\n   res];\n\n(* The adjoint (L=2) forms for comparison: Psi_B(1;0,0) and c^ref = (D(1;0,0) - D(0;0,1))/4. *)\noldCheckK[r_] := With[{st = statesK[r]}, With[{vals = Table[s[\"S\"] psiNK[s, {1, 0, 0}] (dualNK[s, {1, 0, 0}] - dualNK[s, {0, 0, 1}])/4/detNK[r, s, s], {s, st}]},\n    N[Max[Abs[vals/vals[[1]] - 1]], 3]]];\n\nmatchTabK = Table[{Row[r, \",\"], oldCheckK[r], Length[matchPairsK[r]],\n    Column[Row[{Row[#[[1]], \",\"], \"  |  \", Row[#[[2]], \",\"]}] & /@ matchPairsK[r]]}, {r, repsK}];\nGrid[Prepend[matchTabK, {\"rep\", \"spread with adjoint forms Psi(1;0,0), (D(1;0,0)-D(0;0,1))/4\", \"# matching (x | y)\", \"matching x = (a;b,c) | y = (a;b,c)\"}],\n Frame -> All, Alignment -> Left]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<details class=\"vscode-wolfram-message-output\" style=\"color:#f44;border-left:3px solid #f44;background:rgba(255,68,68,0.08);padding:2px 6px;margin:1px 0;border-radius:0 3px 3px 0;font-family:monospace;font-size:0.85em\"><summary style=\"cursor:pointer\">5 warnings</summary><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Power::infy: Infinite expression --------- encountered.                                       -148                                  0. 10</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Infinity::indet: Indeterminate expression 0. 10     ComplexInfinity encountered.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Infinity::indet: Indeterminate expression 0. 10     ComplexInfinity encountered.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">Infinity::indet: Indeterminate expression 0. 10     ComplexInfinity encountered.</div><div style=\"padding:2px 0 2px 4px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,68,68,0.15)\">General::stop: Further output of Infinity::indet will be suppressed during this calculation.</div></details>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
